{
  "$schema": "../gen/schemas/desktop-schema.json",
  "identifier": "app-buddy-list",
  "description": "App-command grants for the `buddy-list` window: friend list management, invites, blocking, community create/join, status/presence, game launch, opening other windows, DM list, strand-relay volunteering, the deep-link consent dialog, `open_external_url` for the menu bar's links, and the call shell it alone hosts (incoming-call modal, call waiting, outgoing and group panels, missed calls) plus the session-reset prompt — the app's home base. No plugin grants.",
